 |Output = Iron Door
}}
}}

== Usage ==
=== Private Island ===
'''Iron Doors''' can be placed as a block on the player's {{Zone|Private Island}} or plots in {{Zone|The Garden}}. However, due to Redstone being disabled on {{Zone|The Garden}}, they cannot be activated there.

